<title>USA: Precision's Huisman named CEO, president.</title>
<headline>Precision's Huisman named CEO, president.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PETERSBURG, Fla. 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Precision Systems Inc said on Thursday it has named Wim Huisman, who was interim president and chief executive, president and chief executive officer, ending the company's executive search.</p>
<p>Huisman was selected as the company's interim president and chief executive officer to replace Russell Pillar, who resigned from the position on September 18, 1996, Precision Systems said.</p>
